                        <tr>
                            <td style="color:orange;">combination Kickboxing and judo</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                           <td>
                                                        <p>
                                                                    One of the weaknesses in kickboxing can be getting close to the opponent, which reduces the opponent’s efficiency. Some people use this method during a fight. Judo can be a suitable choice for dealing with this weakness in kickboxing.

                                </p>
                               <p>
                                   One of the weaknesses in Judo can be the distance from the opponent, as Judo techniques start with a grip. Distance can play an important role in executing Judo techniques. Now, if we want to cover both weaknesses of the two styles (distance and getting close), Judo and Kickboxing can be good complementary sports.

For opponents who work from a distance or close to their opponent, those who work from a distance can use Kickboxing and those who work close to their opponent can use Judo.
                               </p>
